  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When you say the weekly production time for Process II must be \"fully utilized,\" do you mean the 70 regular hours must be completely consumed (i.e., exactly 70 hours of regular Process II time used, with any additional Process II work only via overtime), or do you mean Process II simply cannot exceed 70 regular hours plus whatever overtime is allowed (i.e., it may run below 70 if that is more profitable)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single clarification question asking the user to choose between two specific interpretations of the constraint 'fully utilized'. Although it offers two options, it requires a single decision on the policy definition."
}

